# Copy this file to `supabase/.env` (gitignored — never commit the real
# file) and fill in a real value to enable real email delivery via Resend.
# See the comment above [auth.email.smtp] in config.toml for what else
# that requires (flipping `enabled = true` there, and a stack restart) and
# why it stays off by default (it breaks the Mailpit-based Playwright
# suite while it's on).
#
# Get a key at https://resend.com/api-keys — verified live: the Supabase
# CLI auto-loads this file and resolves config.toml's env(RESEND_API_KEY)
# from it, no shell export needed.
RESEND_API_KEY=
